{"id":"988675a000b87840","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-bestfitpositive.md","title":"Positive best fit by a minimal minimum weight cover","display":"thm-bestfitpositive — Positive best fit by a minimal minimum weight cover","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-bestfitpositive","aliases":["27-thm-bestfitpositive"],"display":"thm-bestfitpositive — Positive best fit by a minimal minimum weight cover","depends_on":["[[27-df-fitconflictgraph]]","[[27-df-bestfit]]","[[27-df-monotone]]","[[27-df-extension]]","[[27-df-fiterror]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.4, Theorem 12.17, F+ proof, (12.22)–(12.24)","source_printed_pages":"549–551","source_pdf_pages":"573–575","verification_status":"source-proof-checked-on-disjoint-input-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-bestfitpositive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-bestfitpositive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bestfitpositive — Positive best fit by a minimal minimum weight cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e4f9577b47a056e\" href=\"?note=9e4f9577b47a056e\" title=\"27-df-fitconflictgraph\">27-df-fitconflictgraph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.4, Theorem 12.17, F+ proof, (12.22)–(12.24)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"549–551"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"573–575"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-checked-on-disjoint-input-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=T\\cap F\">\\(I=T\\cap F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0=T\\setminus F\">\\(T_0=T\\setminus F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0=F\\setminus T\">\\(F_0=F\\setminus T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0=w\\upharpoonright(T_0\\cup F_0)\">\\(w_0=w\\upharpoonright(T_0\\cup F_0)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq b\">\\(a\\leq b\\)</span> 为坐标序。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq T_0\\cup F_0\">\\(U\\subseteq T_0\\cup F_0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinVC}_n,\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MinVC}_n,\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n\\)</span> 定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9e4f9577b47a056e\" href=\"?note=9e4f9577b47a056e\" title=\"27-df-fitconflictgraph\">27-df-fitconflictgraph</a>；最优函数族、递增函数类和扩张族分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_U,F_U,g_U\">\\(T_U,F_U,g_U\\)</span> 由下式给出。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BestFit}_n,\\mathrm{Err}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"715fc2a2ad4968cc\" href=\"?note=715fc2a2ad4968cc\" title=\"27-df-bestfit\">27-df-bestfit</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a> 的精确接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a> 的固定元数接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_U\\coloneqq(T_0\\setminus U)\\cup(F_0\\cap U),\\qquad F_U\\coloneqq(T_0\\cap U)\\cup(F_0\\setminus U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_U\\coloneqq(T_0\\setminus U)\\cup(F_0\\cap U),\\qquad F_U\\coloneqq(T_0\\cap U)\\cup(F_0\\setminus U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g_U\\coloneqq\\{(x,1)\\mid x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\land\\exists a\\in T_U\\;(a\\leq x)\\}\\cup\\{(x,0)\\mid x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\land\\forall a\\in T_U\\;(a\\nleq x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g_U\\coloneqq\\{(x,1)\\mid x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\land\\exists a\\in T_U\\;(a\\leq x)\\}\\cup\\{(x,0)\\mid x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\land\\forall a\\in T_U\\;(a\\nleq x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T_0,F_0,w_0)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T_0,F_0)\\ne\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T_0,F_0,w_0)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T_0,F_0)\\ne\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T_0,F_0,w_0)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T_0,F_0)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad g_U\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T_U,F_U)\\cap\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathrm{Monotone}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\in\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T_0,F_0,w_0)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T_0,F_0)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad g_U\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T_U,F_U)\\cap\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathrm{Monotone}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T_0,F_0,w_0)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T_0,F_0)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{Err}_n(g_U;T,F,w)=\\mathrm W_w(I)+\\mathrm W_{w_0}(U)=\\min_{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n}\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\in\\mathrm{MinVC}_n(T_0,F_0,w_0)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n(T_0,F_0)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{Err}_n(g_U;T,F,w)=\\mathrm W_w(I)+\\mathrm W_{w_0}(U)=\\min_{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n}\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Theorem 12.17 的 F+ 证明与 (12.22)–(12.24)，印刷页 549–550 / PDF 第 573–574 页；相应不相交样本论证已逐项核对。此条先去掉冲突样本并添加固定代价，消除原书翻转公式在相交标签上的集合编码歧义。按字面无标签集合解释，例如原始 T=F={a} 时，不论 a 是否在 U，(12.23) 与 (12.24) 都把 a 留在两边，不能得到所声称划分。Figure 12.9（印刷页 551 / PDF 第 575 页）把重叠点画成左右两个顶点，提示作者可能意图使用带标签的顶点副本，但公式未显式编码该副本；本条采用先处理冲突点的无歧义集合版本，不据此否定其带标签算法意图。</p>\n<p>本地证明：覆盖集合有限非空，所以最小权覆盖存在；从中选包含关系下极小者，非负权保证删去冗余点不会提高权重，故仍为最小权覆盖。每个递增函数的误分类点集覆盖全部冲突边，故误差至少为最小覆盖权。若翻转后的 a∈T_U、b∈F_U 满足 a≤b，当 a∈T_0\\U、b∈F_0\\U 时违反覆盖条件；当 a∈T_0\\U、b∈T_0∩U 时，b 的每个邻点也邻接 a，故都在 U，b 可删，违反极小性。若 a∈F_0∩U，则 a 的每个 T_0 邻点 a′≤a≤b；若 a′不在 U，归结到前两种矛盾；故所有邻点都在 U，a 可删，仍矛盾。因此没有这种 a≤b，所定义上闭包函数 g_U 恰扩张翻转样本，误分类集恰为 U。冲突点各加 w(a)，结论成立。有限测试另列；未形式化计算位复杂度，也未核验原书被省略的其他函数类 NP-hardness 证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-fitconflictgraph","status":"resolved","id":"9e4f9577b47a056e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-fitconflictgraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bestfit","status":"resolved","id":"715fc2a2ad4968cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bestfit]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-monotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"re